# Projection: GMEOW → pure schema-org. GENERATED by `gmeow compile-mappings` from mapping-dsl/ — DO NOT EDIT.
# Lossy and directional by design; drops: precise coordinates coarsened to the enclosing region at gmeow:coarsenTo level (privacy generalization, P10); the specialized GMEOW parthood subproperty, if any, is collapsed to generic schema:isPartOf; the specialized GMEOW whole-to-part subproperty, if any, is collapsed to generic schema:hasPart; authority provenance, confidence, standpoint, and exact-vs-close match distinction collapse to a schema.org identity URL; skos:closeMatch authority links are not emitted; projection frame = endonym-preferred; co-equal exonyms projected as schema:alternateName; non-displayable/superseded and competing-standpoint names dropped; exonym selection is locale-relative; competing-standpoint names and names with specific purposes dropped; non-displayable names (deadnames) dropped; orientation + sexAssignedAtBirth dropped; sex/gender conflated; Glottocodes excluded; only 2-3 letter primary subtags; CEFR/ILR/ACTFL level and skill modality dropped; the birth Participation (role, period, confidence, standpoint) and fuzzy-date bounds are dropped; only the principal's birth instant survives as schema:birthDate; the Participation's period / confidence / evidence / standpoint collapse to a flat schema:attendee edge; the Participation's period / confidence / evidence / standpoint collapse to a flat schema:performer edge; the Participation's period / confidence / evidence / standpoint collapse to a flat schema:organizer edge; the uncertainty band (gmeow:latestEnd) and the gmeow:temporalPrecision qualifier are dropped; only the earliest bound survives as a single schema:startDate; the Copyright relator (year, notice, status) collapses to a flat schema:copyrightHolder edge; the Copyright relator (holder, notice, status) collapses to a flat schema:copyrightYear edge; the structured Copyright relator (holder, year, status) collapses to a flat schema:copyrightNotice edge; tag IRI lost; only label text emitted; displayable false tags suppressed; tagger, s